1
00:00:14,014 --> 00:00:17,684
This is Ranma of the Saotome
School of Anything Goes Martial Arts.

2
00:00:18,518 --> 00:00:21,021
And this is Akane from the Tendo Dojo.

3
00:00:22,022 --> 00:00:25,191
These two teens were arranged
to be married by their parents.

4
00:00:25,275 --> 00:00:26,776
Don't tell me what to do.

5
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:28,319
You're such a pain in the butt.

6
00:00:28,403 --> 00:00:31,448
Unfortunately,
Ranma has a bit of a problem.

7
00:00:34,034 --> 00:00:35,702
What the hell, man?

8
00:00:35,785 --> 00:00:39,706
Whenever he's splashed with cold water,
he changes into a girl.

9
00:00:46,296 --> 00:00:50,550
RANMA1/2

10
00:02:12,048 --> 00:02:13,550
KOLKHOZ HIGH SCHOOL

11
00:02:14,551 --> 00:02:17,595
- The Charlotte Cup?
- What's that about?

12
00:02:17,679 --> 00:02:18,680
I'LL NEVER LET GO

13
00:02:18,763 --> 00:02:22,475
- Sanzenin's going to be in this.
- Ooh! We've got to go cheer him on.

14
00:02:23,101 --> 00:02:24,769
What's all this Charlotte Cup crap?

15
00:02:25,270 --> 00:02:26,521
It's getting ridiculous now.

16
00:02:27,605 --> 00:02:29,023
No matter what happens,

17
00:02:29,107 --> 00:02:31,943
Akane and I will get to pair together
for this match,

18
00:02:32,026 --> 00:02:33,820
and we'll win!

19
00:02:35,989 --> 00:02:38,616
Oh, I was looking everywhere for you,
"Charlotte."

20
00:02:40,743 --> 00:02:42,912
If I'm the one pairing up with Akane,

21
00:02:42,996 --> 00:02:44,414
I'll be unbeatable.

22
00:02:44,497 --> 00:02:46,958
So just sit back and watch
from the stands, okay?

23
00:02:50,670 --> 00:02:52,005
MARTIAL SKATING
BOYS' DRESSING ROOM

24
00:03:01,723 --> 00:03:02,807
Hmm.

25
00:03:04,309 --> 00:03:05,602
Perfect, as usual.

26
00:03:05,685 --> 00:03:06,561
Hmm?

27
00:03:08,688 --> 00:03:10,523
Oh. Hey, my corny sex pest.

28
00:03:10,607 --> 00:03:13,234
It's Mikado Sanzenin!

29
00:03:14,402 --> 00:03:16,362
Have you healed up
from all the hits you took?

30
00:03:16,446 --> 00:03:19,782
Huh. I might have allowed my guard
to slip the other day.

31
00:03:20,575 --> 00:03:23,369
But an official match is going to play out
very differently.

32
00:03:25,371 --> 00:03:29,417
So, your partner...
It's Akane Tendo, if I recall?

33
00:03:29,500 --> 00:03:30,501
Uh...

34
00:03:32,170 --> 00:03:34,923
I don't believe I've had the chance
to greet her properly.

35
00:03:35,506 --> 00:03:36,674
What does that mean?

36
00:03:38,593 --> 00:03:40,053
I'll state this for the record.

37
00:03:40,637 --> 00:03:45,516
The sweet lips of Akane Tendo will be
mine to steal and smother

38
00:03:45,600 --> 00:03:47,560
the second you lose our match.

39
00:03:47,644 --> 00:03:49,020
What the hell did you say?

40
00:03:50,313 --> 00:03:53,942
Do you have the ability to think about
anything else, or is this it, you creeper?

41
00:03:54,525 --> 00:03:58,071
Look inside my mind.
You'll find it's full of such genius.

42
00:03:59,906 --> 00:04:01,574
This guy's freakin' weird.

43
00:04:03,409 --> 00:04:05,620
I guess
someone's talking about me.

44
00:04:06,454 --> 00:04:07,830
Huh.

45
00:04:09,082 --> 00:04:10,959
There's palpable excitement in the air

46
00:04:11,042 --> 00:04:13,211
here at the Kolkhoz High School ice rink.

47
00:04:13,753 --> 00:04:15,421
Students are pouring into the venue

48
00:04:15,505 --> 00:04:17,090
so that they may bear witness

49
00:04:17,173 --> 00:04:20,260
to the apocalyptic showdown
that is only moments away.

50
00:04:20,343 --> 00:04:22,178
The fateful Charlotte Cup match,

51
00:04:22,262 --> 00:04:25,056
which pits Kolkhoz and Furinkan
High Schools against each other,

52
00:04:25,139 --> 00:04:26,808
is about to begin.

53
00:04:26,891 --> 00:04:28,434
This will be a battle on ice.

54
00:04:28,518 --> 00:04:32,897
These chilling vibes are reminiscent
of Alexander Nevsky's historic clash

55
00:04:32,981 --> 00:04:36,109
from 1242, before defeating his invaders
on a frozen lake.

56
00:04:36,192 --> 00:04:38,111
Will it be Kolkhoz or Furinkan High School

57
00:04:38,194 --> 00:04:41,239
to seize victory today and go on
to become the modern Nevsky?

58
00:04:41,322 --> 00:04:42,448
This is live commentary,

59
00:04:42,532 --> 00:04:45,952
provided by the team you love,
Ichiro and the Furinkan Radio Club.

60
00:04:51,541 --> 00:04:52,875
They've just lowered the lights

61
00:04:52,959 --> 00:04:55,628
to give both teams
the chance to enter the rink.

62
00:04:58,506 --> 00:05:00,633
The golden pair of Martial Skating,

63
00:05:00,717 --> 00:05:04,012
Azusa Shiratori and Mikado Sanzenin,
make their entrance!

64
00:05:12,687 --> 00:05:14,981
It's Sanzenin!

65
00:05:15,064 --> 00:05:19,027
Azusa! Azusa!

66
00:05:19,110 --> 00:05:22,530
Hmm. Do they have to make
this big of a deal with their entrance?

67
00:05:22,613 --> 00:05:23,614
I know, right?

68
00:05:25,366 --> 00:05:27,785
Try not to get too close to Sanzenin
if you can.

69
00:05:27,869 --> 00:05:29,996
Hmm? What are you talking about?

70
00:05:30,580 --> 00:05:33,708
How am I supposed to attack him
if I can't get close?

71
00:05:33,791 --> 00:05:35,126
Okay, but still...

72
00:05:35,793 --> 00:05:37,712
Come on. We're making our entrance next.

73
00:05:37,795 --> 00:05:38,796
Mmm.

74
00:05:39,589 --> 00:05:42,091
All right, then we can be flashy too!

75
00:05:43,551 --> 00:05:46,262
Time for us to go out
and stun 'em with our skills!

76
00:05:46,346 --> 00:05:48,222
Wait a second, Ranma!

77
00:05:51,476 --> 00:05:52,894
Ah! Here we go.

78
00:05:52,977 --> 00:05:54,896
Akane and Ranma are now on the ice.

79
00:05:54,979 --> 00:05:56,856
Their entrance is absolutely stunning.

80
00:05:56,939 --> 00:06:00,234
Argh! Stop! Stop!

81
00:06:02,612 --> 00:06:04,113
Whoa!

82
00:06:08,493 --> 00:06:09,952
Argh! Shut your mouth!

83
00:06:12,372 --> 00:06:16,084
The way I'm seeing it, Charlotte is
totally going to come home with me today.

84
00:06:18,127 --> 00:06:19,879
You're wrong!

85
00:06:19,962 --> 00:06:22,256
I'm never gonna let you take P-chan.

86
00:06:24,550 --> 00:06:26,469
The match is starting.

87
00:06:26,552 --> 00:06:29,222
A pet pig's fate hangs in the balance.

88
00:06:29,305 --> 00:06:32,934
This no-holds-barred match will be
a single round ending in a knockout.

89
00:06:34,185 --> 00:06:37,063
- We can win this if we get the first hit!
- Yeah.

90
00:06:37,146 --> 00:06:39,273
Both pairs are off
to a smooth start.

91
00:06:39,357 --> 00:06:41,943
The Furinkan team releases
a death spiral kick.

92
00:06:42,652 --> 00:06:43,736
Huh?

93
00:06:44,320 --> 00:06:46,656
- You look particularly cute today.
- Ugh.

94
00:06:48,491 --> 00:06:50,410
Oh! We know this one, folks!

95
00:06:50,493 --> 00:06:52,912
Sanzenin's going straight for
his special Kiss Attack!

96
00:06:53,955 --> 00:06:55,498
Ew!

97
00:06:56,165 --> 00:06:58,251
Not on my watch!

98
00:06:58,334 --> 00:07:00,253
- Ranma, look out!
- Huh?

99
00:07:00,336 --> 00:07:03,548
It's a surprise diving knee drop!
That looks like it hurt!

100
00:07:03,631 --> 00:07:05,007
Ranma!

101
00:07:05,091 --> 00:07:07,427
I finally have you to myself.

102
00:07:07,510 --> 00:07:09,887
Get lost!

103
00:07:12,515 --> 00:07:16,519
Poor girl. There's no need to play shy.
That kiss was yours to keep.

104
00:07:16,602 --> 00:07:18,688
She's looking pretty grossed-out to me.

105
00:07:19,439 --> 00:07:21,816
You know, I could really use
your help here.

106
00:07:23,359 --> 00:07:26,737
The more rejection I come to face,
the more motivated I become.

107
00:07:28,865 --> 00:07:30,825
I'll do anything to steal those lips!

108
00:07:37,915 --> 00:07:39,959
Akane, stay out of the way.

109
00:07:41,919 --> 00:07:43,838
The Furinkan pair performs
a throw jump!

110
00:07:48,676 --> 00:07:50,761
In a flash,
he landed a right straight!

111
00:07:56,058 --> 00:07:57,768
Fence! Fence! Fence! Fence!

112
00:07:57,852 --> 00:07:58,936
Yeah, I know!

113
00:07:59,020 --> 00:08:00,271
You gotta stop now!

114
00:08:00,354 --> 00:08:02,148
I wish I could!

115
00:08:02,231 --> 00:08:04,150
That's a heck of a backflip!

116
00:08:04,859 --> 00:08:06,694
Whoa!

117
00:08:11,741 --> 00:08:13,868
Oh! Hey, does doing this hurt?

118
00:08:13,951 --> 00:08:16,078
How about now? Does this hurt?

119
00:08:16,162 --> 00:08:17,705
What about now?

120
00:08:17,788 --> 00:08:19,457
Does it hurt now?
You can tell me if it hurts.

121
00:08:19,540 --> 00:08:22,710
Stop jabbing me in that spot,
you stupid girl!

122
00:08:22,793 --> 00:08:25,296
It's only 'cause I'm so worried about you,
you know?

123
00:08:27,340 --> 00:08:28,341
Huh?

124
00:08:29,425 --> 00:08:33,054
I have to admit that was a surprise.
You hurt me enough to take a knee.

125
00:08:33,638 --> 00:08:36,390
If you try to put your greasy mitts
all over Akane again,

126
00:08:36,474 --> 00:08:38,684
you're gonna need a lot more
than taking a knee.

127
00:08:38,768 --> 00:08:41,771
Oh. What will you do to me?

128
00:08:41,854 --> 00:08:44,023
Ugh. I'll knock you into a coffin.

129
00:08:44,649 --> 00:08:47,652
Listen up! Akane is already engaged to me.

130
00:08:47,735 --> 00:08:48,778
And if you touch her again,

131
00:08:48,861 --> 00:08:52,323
I'll kill you.

132
00:08:54,033 --> 00:08:55,576
Does he really mean that?

133
00:08:56,536 --> 00:08:59,539
Huh. She's your fiancée, huh?

134
00:08:59,622 --> 00:09:03,042
So you're not married yet.
How convenient for me.

135
00:09:03,125 --> 00:09:05,753
I still have a chance
to rip apart your bond.

136
00:09:06,337 --> 00:09:09,006
We might be the golden pair
of Martial Skating,

137
00:09:09,090 --> 00:09:11,008
but we're also known by another name...

138
00:09:14,637 --> 00:09:16,931
The Bone-Chilling
Matchbreakers on Ice!

139
00:09:17,014 --> 00:09:18,099
That's right.

140
00:09:18,766 --> 00:09:22,770
Sanzenin and Shiratori unleash
their ultimate technique,

141
00:09:23,563 --> 00:09:25,273
the Couple Crusher!

142
00:09:26,274 --> 00:09:28,776
No couple has ever survived this attack.

143
00:09:28,859 --> 00:09:31,821
At least not without having
a nasty public break-up first!

144
00:09:31,904 --> 00:09:33,948
Till us, that is. You ready?

145
00:09:34,031 --> 00:09:35,032
Uh, yeah.

146
00:09:37,535 --> 00:09:39,036
Try and stay focused.

147
00:09:44,542 --> 00:09:46,210
Mmm?

148
00:09:46,961 --> 00:09:49,338
Hey! What do you think you're doing?

149
00:09:49,922 --> 00:09:51,299
I'm winning the match.

150
00:09:51,799 --> 00:09:53,384
Whoa.

151
00:09:59,265 --> 00:10:00,474
Whoa.

152
00:10:10,693 --> 00:10:12,528
Well, there it is!

153
00:10:12,612 --> 00:10:15,239
This is the terrifying Couple Crusher.

154
00:10:15,323 --> 00:10:18,242
It's a nasty-looking
Farewell Merry-go-Round.

155
00:10:23,372 --> 00:10:26,250
All you have to do is let go,
and then I stop the spinning.

156
00:10:26,334 --> 00:10:28,336
Yes. Like hell I will!

157
00:10:28,419 --> 00:10:30,421
Just let go of me, Ranma.

158
00:10:30,504 --> 00:10:33,007
No, idiot, you'll get slammed if I do.

159
00:10:35,676 --> 00:10:38,846
He can only be saved if he betrays
his partner and lets go of her.

160
00:10:39,347 --> 00:10:41,098
Let my hands go already.

161
00:10:41,182 --> 00:10:43,726
After I heard what he said
I'm never letting go.

162
00:10:43,809 --> 00:10:46,103
Huh. The deeper your trust in each other,

163
00:10:46,187 --> 00:10:48,981
the greater your sense of betrayal
when your partner lets go.

164
00:10:49,649 --> 00:10:53,110
Any couple unlucky enough to be caught
in the Farewell Merry-go-Round

165
00:10:53,194 --> 00:10:54,445
is doomed to break up.

166
00:10:54,528 --> 00:10:57,531
You don't have to believe
what he says.

167
00:10:57,615 --> 00:10:59,992
I'll be fine, so just let go.

168
00:11:00,076 --> 00:11:01,952
No, you dummy!

169
00:11:02,036 --> 00:11:04,413
I'm not about to let you fly solo.

170
00:11:04,497 --> 00:11:08,459
- You're too stupid to be left alone.
- What... What did you say?

171
00:11:08,542 --> 00:11:11,629
I'm, like, getting so tired now.

172
00:11:11,712 --> 00:11:13,089
I'm done with this.

173
00:11:39,782 --> 00:11:42,326
Through all of it,
he never let go of her hand.

174
00:11:42,410 --> 00:11:44,745
The Farewell Merry-go-Round
has been defeated!

175
00:11:45,579 --> 00:11:47,415
Although it seems like he took
a lot of damage.

176
00:11:47,498 --> 00:11:49,625
Can Ranma Saotome get back on his feet?

177
00:11:49,709 --> 00:11:52,420
Idiot! You had to show off.

178
00:11:52,503 --> 00:11:54,255
You didn't have to take it this far.

179
00:11:57,091 --> 00:11:58,092
Ranma?

180
00:11:59,885 --> 00:12:01,178
Are you okay, Ranma?

181
00:12:02,138 --> 00:12:05,808
If I were to guess,
every bone in his body is probably broken.

182
00:12:05,891 --> 00:12:08,310
If he survived that he'd be a monster.

183
00:12:08,894 --> 00:12:11,897
He did all this for me...

184
00:12:12,898 --> 00:12:17,111
Ranma, why are you so stupid?

185
00:12:19,739 --> 00:12:20,948
Come on!

186
00:12:21,031 --> 00:12:24,243
Is it really that hard for you
to throw out a "sorry" or a "thank you"?

187
00:12:28,247 --> 00:12:29,874
- Mmm?
- You were faking it?

188
00:12:29,957 --> 00:12:31,917
Okay, but who's the idiot now?

189
00:12:32,001 --> 00:12:34,545
Dummy. I was worried about you.

190
00:12:34,628 --> 00:12:37,965
Huh. You really think
something like that could take me out?

191
00:12:41,177 --> 00:12:43,095
It hurts...

192
00:12:43,888 --> 00:12:45,473
So you got up.

193
00:12:45,556 --> 00:12:48,142
Yeah. This match is just gettin' started.

194
00:12:48,684 --> 00:12:50,352
The match is resuming.

195
00:12:50,436 --> 00:12:52,730
The Charlotte Cup battle
over the fate of a pig.

196
00:12:52,813 --> 00:12:54,440
Which of these young pairs will win?

197
00:12:54,523 --> 00:12:55,858
Hey, the pig is missing.

198
00:12:55,941 --> 00:12:57,109
What?

199
00:12:57,193 --> 00:12:59,695
Charlotte, no.

200
00:12:59,779 --> 00:13:03,365
Eh? Oh. The little piggy went missing?

201
00:13:03,449 --> 00:13:06,994
- Where could he be?
- Hmph. Now it's finally my turn.

202
00:13:09,246 --> 00:13:12,124
You're proving to be
quite a tough nut to crack, aren't you?

203
00:13:12,625 --> 00:13:16,170
Sure am. And I'm
only getting started, Sanzenin.

204
00:13:16,253 --> 00:13:18,839
Hang on. You shouldn't be fighting
in this condition.

205
00:13:18,923 --> 00:13:20,424
I don't wanna hear it.

206
00:13:20,508 --> 00:13:22,802
I'm gonna grab
that weirdo and smash his face.

207
00:13:22,885 --> 00:13:26,472
You're welcome to try.
I can't have you withdraw from the match.

208
00:13:26,555 --> 00:13:28,182
Not before one thing.

209
00:13:28,265 --> 00:13:30,684
I steal a kiss from Akane, just as I pro--

210
00:13:32,478 --> 00:13:34,563
My poor little Charlotte's gone missing!

211
00:13:34,647 --> 00:13:37,066
Why the hell would you do that,
you buffoon?

212
00:13:37,149 --> 00:13:38,567
I want to find Charlotte!

213
00:13:39,193 --> 00:13:40,402
Let's get back out there.

214
00:13:40,486 --> 00:13:42,112
Huh? Hold it right there.

215
00:13:42,196 --> 00:13:43,864
- Huh?
- Hmm.

216
00:13:46,158 --> 00:13:48,702
What the hell did you do that for?

217
00:13:48,786 --> 00:13:50,079
You can't keep pushing yourself.

218
00:13:55,668 --> 00:13:56,877
Please withdraw.

219
00:13:57,503 --> 00:13:58,504
Uh...

220
00:14:03,801 --> 00:14:04,969
Uh, what?

221
00:14:05,052 --> 00:14:06,262
A power outage?

222
00:14:06,345 --> 00:14:08,389
What's going on?
Did someone cut the lights?

223
00:14:09,849 --> 00:14:11,433
Huh?

224
00:14:12,017 --> 00:14:14,311
Be a girl so you can sit back and watch.

225
00:14:16,063 --> 00:14:18,023
Come on, Akane, we can be a pair.

226
00:14:18,858 --> 00:14:22,278
Things were going so well
until you showed up, you bastard.

227
00:14:22,361 --> 00:14:24,697
What's going on now?

228
00:14:25,281 --> 00:14:26,824
Argh! What just happened?

229
00:14:26,907 --> 00:14:28,158
Furinkan High School's pair!

230
00:14:28,242 --> 00:14:30,119
It appears they've been
completely swapped out!

231
00:14:30,828 --> 00:14:33,414
You're not the one
who's supposed to be here.

232
00:14:33,497 --> 00:14:36,083
You're the dumbass
who kept me out here in the first place.

233
00:14:36,166 --> 00:14:37,835
- Take that! And that!
- This! This! This!

234
00:14:37,918 --> 00:14:40,045
Oh, I know that girl with the pigtail.

235
00:14:44,842 --> 00:14:47,303
She accepted a kiss from me
with such grace.

236
00:14:48,137 --> 00:14:51,599
My first kiss was gifted
straight from the lips of Sanzenin.

237
00:14:51,682 --> 00:14:54,476
I'm so happy!

238
00:14:54,560 --> 00:14:55,811
Oh, wait, miss.

239
00:15:00,107 --> 00:15:01,525
You know that's not how it went.

240
00:15:02,109 --> 00:15:03,736
I'm pleased to see you again.

241
00:15:03,819 --> 00:15:05,446
Yeah, I'm sure you are.

242
00:15:07,615 --> 00:15:09,825
Let's just focus
on finishing the match, okay?

243
00:15:09,909 --> 00:15:11,911
- Hold on.
- The hell do you want?

244
00:15:12,870 --> 00:15:13,913
Listen to me.

245
00:15:13,996 --> 00:15:16,498
You're still covered in injuries.

246
00:15:17,333 --> 00:15:19,251
Let me and Akane step in.

247
00:15:19,335 --> 00:15:21,712
The two of us can handle the match
from here.

248
00:15:21,795 --> 00:15:22,838
Got it?

249
00:15:22,922 --> 00:15:25,507
Leave it to us and get out of here!

250
00:15:25,591 --> 00:15:26,592
Hey!

251
00:15:26,675 --> 00:15:28,218
What's going on with these two?

252
00:15:28,302 --> 00:15:31,180
The audience has
suddenly started booing.

253
00:15:31,263 --> 00:15:33,349
Is this in protest at a change in pairs?

254
00:15:33,432 --> 00:15:35,935
I don't give a crap about who's skating.

255
00:15:36,018 --> 00:15:38,562
The outfit that she's wearing isn't
hot enough.

256
00:15:39,229 --> 00:15:40,648
- You're gross.
- You're gross.

257
00:15:41,148 --> 00:15:43,692
We can solve
this problem for you.

258
00:15:44,485 --> 00:15:48,197
Out of nowhere, Kolkhoz High
School's Stylist Club jumps into action.

259
00:15:48,280 --> 00:15:49,865
Here. Right this way, please.

260
00:15:49,949 --> 00:15:51,617
- We're going to need you too.
- Uh, hey...

261
00:15:51,700 --> 00:15:53,827
Yes! This one is so cute!

262
00:15:53,911 --> 00:15:56,330
Wait,
I think this one looks better.

263
00:15:59,083 --> 00:16:02,711
The match is resuming with
a fresh start for our handsome new pair.

264
00:16:03,295 --> 00:16:05,673
Wait a minute.
I was going to pair with Akane.

265
00:16:05,756 --> 00:16:07,341
Well, you're gonna have to deal with me.

266
00:16:07,424 --> 00:16:11,261
Anyway, you said you already know
how to skate, didn't you?

267
00:16:11,345 --> 00:16:14,014
Idiot. When do you think I've had
any time to practice?

268
00:16:14,098 --> 00:16:15,975
- Huh?
- Don't worry about it.

269
00:16:16,058 --> 00:16:17,851
I figured out how to stand and walk.

270
00:16:18,894 --> 00:16:20,312
I'm so sorry, Akane.

271
00:16:20,896 --> 00:16:23,983
I broke my promise.
I wasn't able to give you that kiss.

272
00:16:24,066 --> 00:16:25,567
I don't get why you think I'd want that.

273
00:16:25,651 --> 00:16:28,696
As penance, I'll take you out on a date
after the match.

274
00:16:29,196 --> 00:16:31,240
Mwah.

275
00:16:35,869 --> 00:16:38,747
Here, Akane. Let's pair up.

276
00:16:38,831 --> 00:16:39,832
Right.

277
00:16:40,541 --> 00:16:42,042
Charlotte!

278
00:16:42,918 --> 00:16:45,087
You really are my Charlotte, aren't you?

279
00:16:45,671 --> 00:16:47,131
Huh?

280
00:16:47,214 --> 00:16:51,093
I know that collar. And I definitely gave
this to Charlotte before.

281
00:16:55,180 --> 00:16:57,349
Hmph. What a wild accusation.

282
00:16:57,933 --> 00:17:00,185
- Listen up, that is not my name--
- It's P-chan.

283
00:17:00,269 --> 00:17:02,187
Who are you callin' P-chan?

284
00:17:05,357 --> 00:17:08,402
Looks like you're still struggling
with that damage you took earlier.

285
00:17:08,485 --> 00:17:10,070
Just stay down and get some rest.

286
00:17:10,154 --> 00:17:11,697
Hold on.

287
00:17:13,407 --> 00:17:16,160
You stay put here.
Let me be the one to deal with this.

288
00:17:16,243 --> 00:17:19,163
No way! You're the person
who should be sitting this out.

289
00:17:19,747 --> 00:17:22,249
How many more times do I have
to tell you I'm fine?

290
00:17:22,833 --> 00:17:24,793
Nothing about you is fine right now.

291
00:17:24,877 --> 00:17:25,961
I said I'm okay!

292
00:17:28,088 --> 00:17:30,174
Why are you being
so stubborn about all this?

293
00:17:30,257 --> 00:17:31,967
I don't know. Why are you?

294
00:17:32,051 --> 00:17:34,595
- Ugh. This is why I say you're not cute.
- Hmm.

295
00:17:34,678 --> 00:17:37,139
I'm doing this
because I'm worried about you.

296
00:17:37,222 --> 00:17:39,516
Guess I'll go back to hating you. Hmm.

297
00:17:39,600 --> 00:17:41,018
Let's get out there, Ryoga.

298
00:17:46,315 --> 00:17:47,566
Huh?

299
00:17:52,154 --> 00:17:53,155
Ranma.

300
00:17:54,656 --> 00:17:56,450
The two of us are gonna take him down.

301
00:17:57,034 --> 00:17:58,869
You okay with that, Ryoga?

302
00:18:00,204 --> 00:18:01,789
Like I have a choice.

303
00:18:02,581 --> 00:18:04,958
All right, cool.
We're switching out skaters.

304
00:18:05,042 --> 00:18:06,668
I don't want to hear any whining.

305
00:18:06,752 --> 00:18:08,337
Oh, no complaints here.

306
00:18:08,420 --> 00:18:12,424
I'm flattered to find out just how far
your desire to kiss me will carry you.

307
00:18:12,508 --> 00:18:13,759
It's no problem at all.

308
00:18:16,136 --> 00:18:17,679
We accept your challenge.

309
00:18:18,347 --> 00:18:21,558
Can't say I get what's goin' on,
but let's go, Ryoga.

310
00:18:21,642 --> 00:18:22,643
Yeah!

311
00:18:25,020 --> 00:18:26,980
He must be in excruciating pain.

312
00:18:27,606 --> 00:18:28,607
Stupid Ranma.

313
00:18:31,693 --> 00:18:33,445
Whoa!

314
00:18:33,529 --> 00:18:35,656
What the hell are you doing, idiot?

315
00:18:35,739 --> 00:18:38,033
I already told you,
I don't know how to skate!

316
00:18:38,117 --> 00:18:39,368
- All right.
- Hmm?

317
00:18:43,247 --> 00:18:45,124
Wait! Oh, no, let go of me!

318
00:18:47,292 --> 00:18:49,628
Oh, this is starting off hot.

319
00:18:49,711 --> 00:18:52,214
They're using the signature
Couple Crusher again.

320
00:18:52,297 --> 00:18:54,716
Look at that Farewell Merry-go-Round!

321
00:18:54,800 --> 00:18:57,636
Would you let go of my damn hand,
you doofus.

322
00:18:57,719 --> 00:19:00,806
I'm not letting you go!

323
00:19:03,100 --> 00:19:04,143
That really hurt.

324
00:19:06,061 --> 00:19:08,647
There's nothing more heartbreaking
than this Merry-go-Round.

325
00:19:08,730 --> 00:19:11,024
We're witnessing a deep fracture
in the sacred trust

326
00:19:11,108 --> 00:19:13,277
between lovers in real time!

327
00:19:13,360 --> 00:19:15,279
I don't know. I thought
they kinda hated each other.

328
00:19:15,362 --> 00:19:18,699
Ha! Time to finish
this Farewell Merry-go-Round

329
00:19:19,366 --> 00:19:21,451
with a flourish!

330
00:19:22,578 --> 00:19:24,663
Hmph.

331
00:19:25,247 --> 00:19:26,373
Whee!

332
00:19:30,878 --> 00:19:32,629
What a close call that was.

333
00:19:33,213 --> 00:19:35,299
I pity a poor girl like you.

334
00:19:35,382 --> 00:19:37,759
To be betrayed by someone you believed in...

335
00:19:37,843 --> 00:19:39,761
But you'll soon feel better.

336
00:19:40,971 --> 00:19:43,348
Because after today,
I'm officially your man.

337
00:19:43,432 --> 00:19:45,809
Oh! Sexy Sanzenin!

338
00:19:47,853 --> 00:19:49,771
Stop daydreaming, you creep.

339
00:19:51,940 --> 00:19:53,692
Get your ass up, Ryoga.

340
00:19:57,070 --> 00:19:59,114
Why did this have to be on the ice?

341
00:20:00,073 --> 00:20:03,535
If we didn't have to face off
in this rink, then we would win!

342
00:20:07,748 --> 00:20:10,542
- Ah, that's cold!
- Water?

343
00:20:10,626 --> 00:20:11,960
- Oh, I almost forgot...
- Huh?

344
00:20:12,044 --> 00:20:15,422
This rink was put together
by freezing the top of a swimming pool.

345
00:20:16,423 --> 00:20:20,219
Why didn't you tell us earlier?

346
00:20:20,302 --> 00:20:22,596
The rink has broken apart!

347
00:20:22,679 --> 00:20:25,849
Massive pieces of ice are now drifting
in different directions.

348
00:20:28,602 --> 00:20:30,562
What a fool.

349
00:20:31,146 --> 00:20:32,689
What do we do now, Ryoga?

350
00:20:32,773 --> 00:20:35,525
Right now I'm a girl,
so I can't really say it matters to me.

351
00:20:36,235 --> 00:20:37,986
I can't fall in the water.

352
00:20:38,070 --> 00:20:40,197
What if I turn into a pig
in front of Akane?

353
00:20:41,657 --> 00:20:43,575
Wait, so Ryoga is P-chan?

354
00:20:44,076 --> 00:20:45,911
You lie? How could you do this?

355
00:20:46,495 --> 00:20:48,288
But I... I never meant to lie.

356
00:20:48,372 --> 00:20:49,915
You snuck into my bed.

357
00:20:49,998 --> 00:20:52,626
Is that why you wanted to hide it from me
for so long?

358
00:20:52,709 --> 00:20:53,710
You're gross!

359
00:20:56,004 --> 00:20:58,882
I don't want you to come near me
ever again. Do you hear me?

360
00:20:58,966 --> 00:21:00,384
You stupid perv!

361
00:21:02,177 --> 00:21:03,637
This isn't what I wanted!

362
00:21:04,638 --> 00:21:07,391
It wasn't supposed to be
this way.

363
00:21:07,474 --> 00:21:08,642
Shut up!

364
00:21:08,725 --> 00:21:10,269
Unpack your baggage later.

365
00:21:10,352 --> 00:21:12,562
You want to let Akane see you like this?

366
00:21:14,940 --> 00:21:15,983
Hmm.

367
00:21:17,818 --> 00:21:18,694
Right.

368
00:21:19,278 --> 00:21:21,530
Let's do what we can to finish this.

369
00:21:23,240 --> 00:21:24,825
- Aw.
- Hmm.

370
00:21:24,908 --> 00:21:27,369
Huh? Hmm.
